config APP_USART1_LOOPBACK
	bool "Run bounded PA9-to-PA10 physical loopback verification"
	default n
	help
	  Requires PA9 to be physically connected to PA10. Results are logged on
	  the unchanged USART2/ST-LINK console. Do not enable for normal firmware.

